<title>USA: FREE TO TRADE -- Indiana Housing Authority.</title>
<headline>FREE TO TRADE -- Indiana Housing Authority.</headline>
<text>
<p>INDIANA HOUSING FINANCE AUTHORITY</p>
<p>RE: $35,000,000</p>
<p>SINGLE FAMILY MORTGAGE REVENUE BONDS</p>
<p>1997 SERIES C</p>
<p>Effective at 10:45 A.M. E.D.T., Friday, June 13, 1997</p>
<p>all syndicate terms and price restrictions are removed</p>
<p>and the bonds will be free to trade.</p>
<p>Goldman, Sachs &amp; Co.</p>
<p>PaineWebber Incorporated</p>
<p>Artemis Capital Group, Inc.</p>
<p>John Nuveen &amp; Co. Incorporated</p>
<p>NatCity Investments, Inc.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
